SUMMARY:AYPROS Holiday Pub Club at DayTrip 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\n**We're wrapping up th
 e year with a holiday edition of Pub Club! ❄️**\n\nJoin AYPROS on **We
 dnesday\, December 2**\, for our final Pub Club of 2026 at **DayTrip** in 
 Asheville!\n\nWe're switching things up from our usual Tuesday gathering a
 nd heading to DayTrip for a festive evening of drinks\, familiar faces\, a
 nd hopefully a few new ones. Known for its retro-inspired atmosphere and c
 reative cocktails and mocktails\, DayTrip is a fun spot to close out anoth
 er year of Pub Clubs.\n\nWhether this is your first AYPROS event or you've
  been coming all year\, Pub Club is meant to be easy. No presentations\, n
 o formal agenda\, and no pressure to work the room. Just grab a drink\, ca
 tch up with friends\, and meet a few new people along the way.\n\nWe'll be
  there from **5:00 PM - 8:00 PM**\, and\, as always\, Pub Club is come-and
 -go. Stop by whenever you can!\n\nYour **first drink is on us**\, courtesy
  of our Pub Club Title Sponsor\, **Allen Stahl + Kilbourne (ASK Law)**\, w
 hile drink tickets last. DayTrip will have beer\, mocktails\, and other be
 verages available for purchase.\n\nAnd since it's our holiday edition\, **
 there may or may not be a little karaoke involved…** Stay tuned!\n\n## W
 hat to Expect\n\n* A festive\, relaxed evening at DayTrip\n* Your first dr
 ink included courtesy of ASK Law\, while drink tickets last\n* Beer\, cock
 tails\, mocktails\, and other beverages available for purchase\n* A little
  karaoke\, perhaps?\n* Plenty of time to catch up with friends and meet ot
 her Asheville young professionals\n* First-time attendees and people comin
 g on their own are absolutely welcome\n* No formal networking program or s
 peeches\n\n## Schedule\n\n**5:00 PM** \\- Check\\-in opens\\\, first drink
 s\\\, and Pub Club begins\n**5:00–8:00 PM** \\- Drinks\\\, conversation\
 \\, and holiday festivities\n**8:00 PM** \\- AYPROS Pub Club concludes\n\n
 *Want to keep the night going? Attendees are welcome to hang out in DayTri
 p's main bar afterward\, and DayTrip's free\, public karaoke starts at 9 P
 M!*\n\n***And don't forget your ugly Christmas sweater! It's an AYPROS hol
 iday tradition\, but totally optional.***\n\n## Location\n\n**DayTrip**\n1
 74 Broadway Street\nAsheville\, NC 28801\n\n## Parking\n\nDayTrip is locat
 ed on Broadway Street\, just north of downtown Asheville. Limited parking 
 is available behind the building\, with additional street parking in the s
 urrounding area. Please allow a little extra time to find a spot.\n\nCome 
 when you can\, grab your first drink\, and help us close out 2026 with one
  more Pub Club!\n\nA special thank you to **DayTrip** for hosting us and t
 o **Allen Stahl + Kilbourne (ASK Law)** for continuing to make Pub Club po
 ssible by picking up everyone's first drink.\n\n**We'll see you at DayTrip
 !**
